{"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn9le09ob04re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "What homonyms do you hear, here?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le09ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Have you talked to any of the others?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: Not yet.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I talked to Marybeth.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: How's Marybeth?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: She is frustrated. How are you doing?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le09ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: It is abhorrent how our former company treated us by keeping on scab workers and phasing out the older workers. It isn't right, is it? Their management style is completely aberrant. The thing that frustrates me the most, is that their economic policy is not economical. In the long run they lose money because they have inexperienced staff which will cost them customers.\n<br/>It is so ridiculous, isn't it? Every cell in my body is furious.<br/><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: It's tough. Don't be fazed by this. You don't have to sell your car just yet. You are looking for other work now, aren't you? Or are you going to lie low for awhile?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: No, but first I'm going to complain to our union about a former company.  Have you spoken to them?<br/><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: No, I haven't.", "id": 2, "time": "10290", "image": "engenn9le09ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: They can't do that to people. I'm not going to lie about what happened there. Afterwards, if I don't have my job back, I will start looking for something. I might start my own business.  You have talked to some companies, haven't you?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: No, not yet. You're more ambitious than I am. Your connections at Turbo Store might come in handy though.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: Yeah they might. I'm just still so angry. You're angry, aren't you?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: To be honest, I'm okay. I want to move on to something else. I think I have some ideas and I just need to focus and find my interest. There are going to be interesting times ahead, aren't there?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: Yes, there are.", "id": 3, "time": "59100", "image": "engenn9le09ob04re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le09ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le09ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}